# Pins for the Cilium form of the PROD-MAN-04 acceptance profile (hostname egress).
#
# These two values are DELIBERATELY EMPTY in the repository. The builder of this profile had no network and
# will not write a version or a checksum it has not read from the publisher. kind-cilium-up.sh refuses to run
# until both are set, either here or in the environment:
#
#   ZENITH_CILIUM_CHART_VERSION   a released Cilium chart version, for example the one your production cluster
#                                 runs (a Cilium release that supports CiliumNetworkPolicy toFQDNs and
#                                 egressDeny; every supported release does)
#   ZENITH_CILIUM_CHART_SHA256    sha256 of https://helm.cilium.io/cilium-<version>.tgz, computed by you from a
#                                 download you trust (sha256sum cilium-<version>.tgz)
#
# The script downloads exactly that chart, refuses a checksum mismatch, renders it with helm and refuses
# if any image it would run is not pinned by digest (release charts pin images by digest by default).
ZENITH_CILIUM_CHART_VERSION=
ZENITH_CILIUM_CHART_SHA256=
